{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは質問返します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シマムラは女性物おおいでしょ？\n好き嫌い激しい？\nダイエットするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性物もあるよ！\n好き嫌いあまりないなっ！ダイエットはぁ(笑)なかなか出来てないねぇ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの名前覚えるのはやい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく来てくれる人は覚えてる！でも早いっていわれる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度名前言うから覚えてくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとあだ名だから気になってた(笑)教えて(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姫様になりたいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかんな〜い(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし自分の名前が漢字だったらなにがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平仮名がいい(笑)ハイ！答えになってないね(笑)Sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁぁぁはお城に住んでるの？もしかしてシンデレラ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お城住みたい(笑)シンデレラよ〜ん♪あはっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ムーミンしってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる！似てるって言われたことある(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日暮警部！逮捕しますか？ところでコナンくんどうして犯人がわかったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逮捕ではないが仕返しをするべ！\n私の隣で寝てたからすぐ犯人がわかりました！ドヤッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犯人逮捕ですか？アミアミ？容疑者はなんて申しておるのか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁばれた？そうようちよ！と申しておった！君！罪を感じてないだろ(笑)\n結構あっさりでした(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがすべてさ！ってどういう意味？ファンが残した言葉？\nそれてもまあやが握手会ですべてをだしきったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方に決めてもらったの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風に飛ばされなかった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろめくだけで飛ばなかったよ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと乃木坂４６におってな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前ですよ！いさせてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"移動はバスだったみたいだが体調崩してない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を何者だとおもっとるのじゃっ！崩さないよ(笑)心配ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校始まった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校はどこもはじまってるよ〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな怖いこと言わないでー許してくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいよ！仲直りねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスクしたまま寝て苦しくなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！大丈夫だったよ☆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひいてない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとやそっとじゃ風邪ひかないよ☆まあやだから♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺ気持ちそう(笑)プニプニさせてくんない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぬっ！プニプニだと〜！！！ドンタッチミー！うそ×２(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本格的に新学期始まったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこの学校も始まってますよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父親より年上だとおもわれる男がきたらどうおもいますか？どうもおもわない？引きますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引くわけないじゃん！\nほんとにもぉ(笑)じゃけぇまた今度会いに来て(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスクが大きいの？顔が小さいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスクは女性用で大きくないが顔は普通だと思いますねっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ答えれてないから待ってて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近プールに行くとおじぃちゃんおばぁちゃんと仲良くなるの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばぁちゃん\n『おめめが綺麗だねぇ』\nまあや\n『え〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことないですー』\nおばぁちゃん\n『心が綺麗だからおめめが綺麗なのよ！\nあと貴方は健康的な肌の色してるね！\n野菜も沢山食べるのよ！』\nまあや\n『うん！健康的な肌の色してる？？？\nうーん！モヤシ沢山食べてるから大丈夫！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな普通な会話で仲良くなる(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元に帰ってるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいねぇヤッパリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達も暖かい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日東京戻るから家の近くの神社でも行って東京戻ろうかなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私から質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯物すると"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服に毎回シミがつく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でだろぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教えて〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/6821781/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"}],"source":"archive"}